1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Forty-First Episode
The Secret Letter

15
00:02:02,741 --> 00:02:05,414
Princess, I see that
for some time now...

16
00:02:05,461 --> 00:02:08,100
...you do nothing but read
letters, instead of studying.

17
00:02:08,141 --> 00:02:10,655
Remember that you have
duties toward yourself...

18
00:02:10,701 --> 00:02:12,612
and toward your rank!

19
00:02:14,701 --> 00:02:16,532
Today we will study mathematics.

20
00:02:16,581 --> 00:02:18,731
Mathematics is a
very important subject.

21
00:02:18,781 --> 00:02:20,851
The first school of
mathematics was established...

22
00:02:20,901 --> 00:02:23,017
...by the Greek
mathematician Archimedes!

23
00:02:23,061 --> 00:02:25,939
It was established by the
Greek mathematician Pythagoras.

24
00:02:26,661 --> 00:02:29,129
Well, well, well! I
was testing you.

25
00:02:29,181 --> 00:02:31,411
Of course it was Pythagoras!
Everyone knows that!

26
00:02:31,461 --> 00:02:34,817
Letter for the Princess
from Prince Franz!

27
00:02:36,621 --> 00:02:38,134
Princess!

28
00:02:46,301 --> 00:02:48,178
Present arms!

29
00:03:12,781 --> 00:03:15,693
Go away! Go away!
Go away!

30
00:03:17,181 --> 00:03:20,014
Thank you! You are the kindest dog
that I know.

31
00:03:26,421 --> 00:03:29,254
There we go, I'm finished, Goru.
Take it to her immediately!

32
00:03:57,141 --> 00:03:59,177
But why isn't Goru coming?

33
00:04:02,461 --> 00:04:04,497
Enough, I can't wait anymore!

34
00:04:06,141 --> 00:04:07,813
Excuse me!

35
00:04:10,261 --> 00:04:13,537
- What the devil is wrong with him? - The Prince
is a bit strange these days.

36
00:04:13,581 --> 00:04:16,334
He is always sitting
behind the desk reading.

37
00:04:16,381 --> 00:04:19,930
Reading? Studying, you mean!
My nephew is a serious person.

38
00:04:19,981 --> 00:04:21,892
He is preparing
to become a King.

39
00:04:21,941 --> 00:04:25,456
And what is this? A letter?
But what does it mean? Look at this!

40
00:04:25,501 --> 00:04:27,571
But why is there a heart drawn on it?

41
00:04:28,301 --> 00:04:30,735
A heart?
Then it's a love letter!

42
00:04:30,781 --> 00:04:33,614
I deduce that my nephew is in love.
And why not?

43
00:04:33,661 --> 00:04:35,811
All young people fall in love,
sooner or later.

44
00:04:35,861 --> 00:04:38,011
There is really no reason
to worry.

45
00:04:38,061 --> 00:04:41,736
I wonder who the girl could be
who has won his heart.

46
00:05:01,501 --> 00:05:03,219
Is what I'm being told true,

47
00:05:03,261 --> 00:05:05,695
that lately there have been
secret contacts...

48
00:05:05,741 --> 00:05:07,811
...between the kingdom of Silverland
and that of Goldland?

49
00:05:07,861 --> 00:05:10,933
Yes! There is a little dog that often
crosses our border!

50
00:05:11,901 --> 00:05:15,689
Perhaps the two countries are secretly
conspiring to invade us.

51
00:05:18,221 --> 00:05:20,781
There he is! There he is! It's the dog!

52
00:05:25,181 --> 00:05:27,172
Yes, yes, it's really him!

53
00:05:27,221 --> 00:05:29,815
He is carrying in his mouth
a letter all in silver.

54
00:05:31,341 --> 00:05:35,698
It must certainly be a secret message
sent by those from Silverland!

55
00:05:35,821 --> 00:05:38,176
Catch that dog and bring it here!

56
00:05:38,221 --> 00:05:39,893
Let's catch him!

57
00:05:52,181 --> 00:05:56,493
Very good! Well done, little dog!
Bravo! You did it!

58
00:06:07,141 --> 00:06:10,053
Leave this dog alone,
if you value your life!

59
00:06:33,660 --> 00:06:36,494
Help! Help! Help!

60
00:06:40,900 --> 00:06:43,460
Don't worry, everything is fine

61
00:06:49,820 --> 00:06:53,211
What a striking man!
Dad, tell me who he is right now!

62
00:06:53,260 --> 00:06:56,173
It's Prince Franz of Goldland.

63
00:06:56,380 --> 00:06:58,770
Prince Franz...
What a beautiful name!

64
00:06:58,820 --> 00:07:01,096
How much I like him!
I love him, Dad!

65
00:07:01,140 --> 00:07:03,371
I absolutely want to marry him!

66
00:07:03,740 --> 00:07:05,891
I want to become his wife.

67
00:07:06,020 --> 00:07:09,491
I want him! I want him! I want him!
And I will have him!

68
00:07:13,460 --> 00:07:16,020
Take it away! Take it away!

69
00:07:17,820 --> 00:07:21,939
I didn't say I want a cake! I
said I want to marry Franz!

70
00:07:22,900 --> 00:07:24,812
No, and no again!

71
00:07:25,820 --> 00:07:29,780
I didn't say that I want
a doll! I hate them!

72
00:07:30,020 --> 00:07:33,218
I want a husband who is
alive! I want Prince Franz!

73
00:07:34,020 --> 00:07:36,615
I don't want these things
that you are bringing me!

74
00:07:36,660 --> 00:07:38,697
I want to marry Franz!

75
00:07:41,580 --> 00:07:44,493
I don't know what to do
anymore to keep her calm...

76
00:07:45,460 --> 00:07:49,090
Then why don't you let her
marry Prince Franz of Goldland?

77
00:07:49,140 --> 00:07:51,336
- But you are...!
- Yes, it's really me.

78
00:07:52,900 --> 00:07:55,210
I have just arrived
from Village X.

79
00:07:55,260 --> 00:07:58,094
I command you to offer your daughter
in marriage to Franz.

80
00:07:58,220 --> 00:08:00,689
He will refuse,
because he is in love with Sapphire.

81
00:08:00,740 --> 00:08:04,336
Thus you can say that his refusal
is an insult to your daughter.

82
00:08:04,900 --> 00:08:07,699
This will be an excellent excuse for you
to finally...

83
00:08:07,740 --> 00:08:10,778
...attack and destroy
that cursed kingdom of Goldland.

84
00:08:10,900 --> 00:08:13,369
And if he were to accept,
you could always invite him here...

85
00:08:13,420 --> 00:08:15,651
...to be able to kill him
by treachery.

86
00:08:15,700 --> 00:08:19,011
But however things go, thanks
to this providential marriage,

87
00:08:19,060 --> 00:08:21,131
we will seize Goldland.

88
00:08:24,500 --> 00:08:29,529
Union X has decided to get rid
of the cursed kingdom of Goldland.

89
00:08:32,500 --> 00:08:35,732
It is giving us too much trouble
to the West.

90
00:08:36,820 --> 00:08:40,370
And Silverland is giving us
too much trouble to the North.

91
00:08:40,420 --> 00:08:42,139
North...

92
00:08:42,700 --> 00:08:44,817
Now it is up to you to choose:

93
00:08:44,861 --> 00:08:47,534
either you side with us
and help us destroy...

94
00:08:47,581 --> 00:08:50,015
...the kingdoms of Goldland
and Silverland,

95
00:08:50,061 --> 00:08:52,655
or you stand against us
and then...

96
00:08:53,101 --> 00:08:55,012
...you will meet the same end.

97
00:09:05,741 --> 00:09:09,814
In fact, I had never noticed that
he was in love with her specifically.

98
00:09:10,181 --> 00:09:12,297
I was also
rather surprised...

99
00:09:12,341 --> 00:09:15,890
...since Princess Teppee,
the only daughter of the King of Charcoalland,

100
00:09:15,941 --> 00:09:18,171
offered to marry
Prince Franz.

101
00:09:18,221 --> 00:09:20,177
Then the letter with the heart...!

102
00:09:20,421 --> 00:09:24,494
The letter with the heart had been
written by Princess Teppee.

103
00:09:24,541 --> 00:09:26,213
Uncle!

104
00:09:26,421 --> 00:09:28,332
What do you want to tell me, uncle?

105
00:09:28,821 --> 00:09:33,099
Franz, listen!
I have wonderful news to give you.

106
00:09:33,661 --> 00:09:36,812
The young Princess to whom
you have written all these days

107
00:09:36,861 --> 00:09:39,898
- is being offered to you in marriage!
- Is it true? You're not kidding me?

108
00:09:39,941 --> 00:09:42,774
- What do you think, uncle?
- You know what?

109
00:09:43,501 --> 00:09:46,777
I tell you that I definitely approve
and that I would approve of any girl

110
00:09:46,821 --> 00:09:49,051
...whom you truly loved!

111
00:09:49,141 --> 00:09:51,336
I don't know how to thank you, uncle!

112
00:09:51,381 --> 00:09:53,178
Come, Goru, let's go!

113
00:10:18,421 --> 00:10:21,219
Sapphire..
Be patient, love.

114
00:10:21,701 --> 00:10:23,612
Soon we will get married

115
00:10:32,341 --> 00:10:34,332
What a beautiful moon tonight!

116
00:10:37,661 --> 00:10:40,892
I wonder if Franz is also
looking at the moon and thinking of me...

117
00:11:06,621 --> 00:11:08,816
Oh, my beloved Franz..

118
00:11:19,461 --> 00:11:22,851
The King of Charcoalland and his daughter!

119
00:11:26,461 --> 00:11:29,055
Hurry up! The Princess,
my Princess,

120
00:11:29,101 --> 00:11:31,740
- She must have already arrived!
- Wait a moment, please!

121
00:11:31,781 --> 00:11:35,296
You must present yourself to your
bride dressed elegantly!

122
00:11:38,021 --> 00:11:40,410
I am truly sorry
for having kept you waiting.

123
00:11:40,461 --> 00:11:42,417
There were some unforeseen circumstances

124
00:11:42,461 --> 00:11:44,531
My nephew Franz
will be here any moment.

125
00:11:44,581 --> 00:11:46,697
He seemed intimidated
by this meeting.

126
00:11:46,741 --> 00:11:49,130
And yet he must have loved you
for a very long time.

127
00:11:51,421 --> 00:11:54,094
His Grace, Prince Franz!

128
00:12:06,021 --> 00:12:07,818
Sapphire...

129
00:12:09,781 --> 00:12:11,578
But you are...!

130
00:12:14,101 --> 00:12:17,138
Yes, I'm Teppee! I'm happy
that you remember me!

131
00:12:17,421 --> 00:12:21,016
I think of nothing else but you, you know?
I think of you day and night.

132
00:12:21,301 --> 00:12:23,417
I love you! I love you so much!

133
00:12:23,461 --> 00:12:25,452
I love you more than my father
and more than my mother,

134
00:12:25,501 --> 00:12:27,332
more than cake and dolls!

135
00:12:27,381 --> 00:12:29,736
I love you more than all this!

136
00:12:29,901 --> 00:12:33,576
Listen to me, Teppee... You don't know...
You can't know...

137
00:12:33,901 --> 00:12:36,131
No, what you are saying is not true!

138
00:12:36,181 --> 00:12:39,014
I know everything, Franz!
Everything I need to know!

139
00:12:39,061 --> 00:12:41,336
No, I can't! Forgive me!

140
00:12:45,901 --> 00:12:49,496
- Forgive me, Teppee! And forget me!
- Prince Franz!

141
00:12:51,101 --> 00:12:53,615
- Father!
- Unforgivable!

142
00:12:53,661 --> 00:12:56,175
He has insulted my honor!
He has insulted my country,

143
00:12:56,221 --> 00:12:59,850
therefore I declare war on Goldland
to avenge the insult!

144
00:13:02,901 --> 00:13:06,257
- Father!
- War to the death!

145
00:13:06,301 --> 00:13:08,656
No! No! Let go of me!
I don't want this, Father!

146
00:13:08,701 --> 00:13:13,252
No! I don't want this! Franz! Franz!

147
00:13:17,541 --> 00:13:19,532
My God, what have I done?

148
00:14:15,461 --> 00:14:18,658
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

149
00:14:21,101 --> 00:14:25,060
The river of Goldland has been
crossed by the enemy army!

150
00:14:25,501 --> 00:14:27,810
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

151
00:14:27,861 --> 00:14:30,898
The castle to the west of Goldland
has fallen into enemy hands!

152
00:14:30,941 --> 00:14:33,694
Our garrison has been destroyed!

153
00:14:34,261 --> 00:14:36,172
They are attacking too fast!

154
00:14:36,221 --> 00:14:39,611
The King of Charcoalland's army
was already ready to go to war!

155
00:14:39,661 --> 00:14:42,892
I am convinced that the
marriage offer was just a trick!

156
00:14:42,941 --> 00:14:44,693
They set a trap for us!

157
00:14:44,741 --> 00:14:48,017
If we don't take action, the
kingdom of Goldland will be defeated...

158
00:14:48,061 --> 00:14:50,814
...and all the people will be
killed. We must do something!

159
00:14:51,461 --> 00:14:54,100
We will fight until the end
for the honor of Goldland!

160
00:14:54,141 --> 00:14:57,497
We must fight and hope
that a miracle saves us!

161
00:15:08,941 --> 00:15:10,738
Goru! Come, Goru!

162
00:15:12,661 --> 00:15:15,380
Goru, take this letter
immediately to Princess Sapphire.

163
00:15:15,421 --> 00:15:17,298
Listen to me, don't get caught.

164
00:15:39,461 --> 00:15:42,692
A letter for Prince
Sapphire from Prince Franz!

165
00:15:43,621 --> 00:15:45,100
Goru!

166
00:15:46,901 --> 00:15:50,735
What?! The King of Charcoalland
has invaded the kingdom of Goldland?!

167
00:15:50,861 --> 00:15:52,658
They invaded Goldland?!

168
00:15:52,701 --> 00:15:56,250
It’s all because of my
negligence, Sapphire.

169
00:15:56,341 --> 00:16:00,095
It’s true that I broke Teppee’s
heart, but I did it for love.

170
00:16:00,781 --> 00:16:04,171
Now I must go to the fortress,
in the North, to save my country.

171
00:16:04,701 --> 00:16:08,250
Sapphire, don’t worry about
me, I will do everything I can.

172
00:16:08,621 --> 00:16:10,532
You must not come to help me.

173
00:16:10,581 --> 00:16:14,130
If you were to come here, Silverland
would also be involved in this war.

174
00:16:16,461 --> 00:16:19,100
Franz! My poor, beloved Franz!

175
00:16:20,261 --> 00:16:24,413
I have an idea! Goru, run
immediately to help Prince Franz!

176
00:16:24,541 --> 00:16:26,418
I will follow you shortly!

177
00:16:42,061 --> 00:16:43,892
Help!

178
00:16:45,021 --> 00:16:48,491
Take him immediately to
the Black Knight’s spirit castle!

179
00:16:50,301 --> 00:16:52,690
This is the end of Goldland!

180
00:17:49,781 --> 00:17:52,898
Prince Franz is a prisoner
in that castle, isn’t he?

181
00:17:54,021 --> 00:17:56,216
Wait! Wait!

182
00:17:56,261 --> 00:17:58,377
I am also looking for
Prince Franz!

183
00:17:58,421 --> 00:18:00,935
I want to help him!
Take me with you, please!

184
00:18:01,261 --> 00:18:04,492
But... But your country is at war
with Goldland, it seems to me.

185
00:18:04,541 --> 00:18:07,851
- Aren't you sworn enemies?
- I don't care at all!

186
00:18:07,901 --> 00:18:10,017
My father is a petty man!

187
00:18:10,061 --> 00:18:14,771
I love Prince Franz! Let's go
help him, let's not waste time!

188
00:18:15,901 --> 00:18:19,018
Alright, come with me, but don't
make me waste time! Let's go!

189
00:18:39,821 --> 00:18:43,370
Cursed vampires of the darkness!
You won't drink my blood!

190
00:19:02,181 --> 00:19:03,819
Watch out!

191
00:19:07,861 --> 00:19:10,091
Don't look down!
Look up!

192
00:19:10,141 --> 00:19:13,178
Keep climbing!
Don't look down!

193
00:19:18,101 --> 00:19:21,093
Goldland will be in our
hands in less than a week.

194
00:19:21,141 --> 00:19:23,132
Then we'll destroy Silverland too.

195
00:19:23,181 --> 00:19:25,649
Are you on our side for
this other venture as well?

196
00:19:25,701 --> 00:19:28,215
But certainly!
You can count on me!

197
00:19:28,701 --> 00:19:31,420
Now I'm going to join
my army!

198
00:19:36,621 --> 00:19:39,010
I think I'll exploit him
a bit longer.

199
00:19:39,061 --> 00:19:42,019
"Exploit people as long as
possible and then throw them away"!

200
00:19:42,061 --> 00:19:45,098
This is the law of
Union X, our philosophy.

201
00:19:57,421 --> 00:20:00,219
Just wait and see if I don't
tell my father everything!

202
00:20:00,261 --> 00:20:03,571
Now, first of all, we
must find Prince Franz.

203
00:20:03,741 --> 00:20:05,732
Come with me, but be careful!

204
00:20:23,541 --> 00:20:26,453
Well done!
Hurray for the phantom knight!

205
00:20:26,501 --> 00:20:29,095
Bravo! Bravo! Bravo! Bravo!

206
00:20:33,661 --> 00:20:35,413
Take this!

207
00:20:38,181 --> 00:20:40,012
Did you get hurt?

208
00:20:40,061 --> 00:20:42,655
How romantic it is
to be saved by you!

209
00:20:42,901 --> 00:20:46,177
But first we must save Franz,
before it's too late!

210
00:20:47,221 --> 00:20:51,851
Franz! Franz, take heart!
We have come to save you!

211
00:20:53,781 --> 00:20:55,851
But this is the voice of my...

212
00:20:59,741 --> 00:21:03,893
Don't come in here! In here
there are the vampires of the darkness!

213
00:21:18,901 --> 00:21:21,893
Franz! I've come to save you!

214
00:21:22,181 --> 00:21:24,775
Thank you!
I owe you my life once again.

215
00:21:57,021 --> 00:21:58,613
Take it!

216
00:22:20,101 --> 00:22:24,094
Oh, how handsome the phantom
knight is! How much I like him!

217
00:22:24,341 --> 00:22:26,457
I think I'll fall in love with him!

218
00:22:42,901 --> 00:22:45,256
I thank you so much,
phantom knight,

219
00:22:45,301 --> 00:22:47,576
for saving Franz and me.

220
00:22:47,621 --> 00:22:50,818
Now I'm running home right away
to tell my father everything,

221
00:22:50,861 --> 00:22:53,739
so he will put a stop to
this stupid war!

222
00:22:54,101 --> 00:22:57,491
There is another thing I want to tell you:
I want to marry you!

223
00:23:00,141 --> 00:23:03,338
I'm so sorry, Franz,
but I think everything is fine,

224
00:23:03,381 --> 00:23:05,292
because you love Sapphire

225
00:23:06,181 --> 00:23:08,490
Yes, forgive me, but it's
really true what you said.

226
00:23:08,541 --> 00:23:11,419
I love Sapphire. I love
her with all my heart.

227
00:23:11,621 --> 00:23:13,737
- What's the matter?
- Nothing.

228
00:23:13,781 --> 00:23:17,171
I can't explain it to you now. You
will understand when you are older.

229
00:23:18,021 --> 00:23:21,377
Alright, but will you wait
until I have grown up?

230
00:23:22,541 --> 00:23:24,179
Farewell!

231
00:23:24,501 --> 00:23:29,495
I love you, phantom knight! I love
you! I love you! I love you so much!

232
00:24:08,380 --> 00:24:12,000
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

233
00:24:12,001 --> 00:24:15,361
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

234
00:24:15,362 --> 00:24:19,132
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

235
00:24:19,133 --> 00:24:22,294
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
